<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
  <h1>One skill opens another door.</h1>
  <p class="lede">LearnLoop runs two ways to learn: free skill-for-skill swaps, and paid, professionally taught courses. Here's how each works.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Free skill exchange</h2>
    <p>No money changes hands — you trade your time and expertise for someone else's.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">01</div><h3>Browse skills</h3><p>Find someone who teaches what you want and wants what you know.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">02</div><h3>Match &amp; message</h3><p>Say hello, propose your trade, and agree on a rhythm.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">03</div><h3>Swap live</h3><p>Meet online or in person. Take turns being mentor and learner.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">04</div><h3>Grow your loop</h3><p>Log your swap, leave feedback, and keep curiosity moving.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="skills-band">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Paid, professional-led courses</h2>
    <p>For when you want a structured curriculum and a real credential, not a casual swap.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
    <div class="step" style="border-color: var(--line);"><div class="step-num">01</div><h3>Subscribe to Pro</h3><p>&#8377;499/month unlocks every course under Learn a New Skill.</p></div>
    <div class="step" style="border-color: var(--line);"><div class="step-num">02</div><h3>Pick a program</h3><p>Choose from Data Science, Photography, UI/UX, or Digital Marketing.</p></div>
    <div class="step" style="border-color: var(--line);"><div class="step-num">03</div><h3>Attend live sessions</h3><p>Weekly sessions with a vetted professional mentor, not a recorded video.</p></div>
    <div class="step" style="border-color: var(--line);"><div class="step-num">04</div><h3>Finish with a portfolio piece</h3><p>Every program ends with a real project or case study you can show.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final-cta">
  <h2>Ready to pick your path?</h2>
  <div class="hero-ctas" style="margin-top:24px;">
    <a href="/skills" class="btn" style="background:var(--cream); color:var(--coral);">Browse free skills</a>
    <a href="/learn" class="btn btn-outline">See Pro courses</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
